al offences, assault: need for specialized help agency for victims of crime \/ satisfaction with the local police \/ fear of crime in local area \/ crime prevention behaviour \/ preferred sentence for a 21 year old recidivist burglar. Background variables: basic characteristics\/ residence\/ housing situation\/ household characteristics\/ occupation\/employment\/ income\/capital assets\/ education\/ consumption of durables.  The most recent International Crime Victimization Surveys can be downloaded from the UNICRI website"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Law"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"crime"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"law"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"safety"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"violence"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"theft"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"crime victims"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"offences"}}]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1992-12-31"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J.J.M. van Dijk, Rijksuniversiteit Leiden, Criminologisch Instituut (depositor)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Interview BV * Amsterdam (data collector)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"20